+                  // (sin 120°, -cos 120°) = (0.866, 0.5) — right and down — over
+                  // the corner-to-corner span (0.866 + 0.5) of a square box:
+                  // ±0.866*1.366 / ±0.5*1.366 in Flutter's -1..1 alignment.
